on the strength of your fists and your agility.\n\nThanks to the experience, the fighters will also be able to unlock different skills, which when needed could turn the tide of the duel.\n\nAre you ready to fight alongside our heroes?", "short_description": "In an unspecified future, the cute and bored aliens decide to enjoy their time in the most ancient game ever: the fight!\nThanks to their advanced technologies they not only create an innovative arena but choose, through a careful selection, characters who have distinguished themselves for their peculiar characteristics throughout the history of the Worlds."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.eyeliensheroes.com/documents/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Floaty S.r.l.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.eyeliensheroes.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1202440767056472"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6367644113340708", "version": "1.1"}, "id": "631976834523628", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binar